# pbmfix.exe on the repo's SAVEGAME.PBM. It writes a line only when it reads a carriage return,
# and git stores that file with LF line ends only, so the fixed file is empty: this records
# that (docs/devnotes.md, "The first builds", Found). pbmfix renames the original SAVEGAME.OLD
# with SHELL "rename", a Windows command. It reads no key; END's "Press any key to continue"
# takes the last one.
#! program pbmfix
#! files SAVEGAME.PBM SAVEGAME.OLD SAVEGAME.FIX

repeat space
